You tried hard, still fail to outrun&lt;br /&gt;
Be aware of two five two one&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I do hope, that it won&#039;t claim prose&lt;br /&gt;
It entangles me, holds me close&lt;br /&gt;
Oh, no! Please, stop! I&#039;m not yet done!&lt;br /&gt;
Be aware of two five two one&lt;/p&gt;
