&lt;p&gt;Inspired by: &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-41d3n73-j&quot;&gt;SCP-41-D3N73-J&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trennerdios&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1277937&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606400314&quot; alt=&quot;trennerdios&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1277937)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trennerdios&quot;  &gt;trennerdios&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
