						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div id="wiki-tabview-1b880f785fe3f68f2408e57e4083ba8d" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>Tubby</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>●●|●●●●●|●●|●</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Harbinger</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Limericks</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Ƹ̵̡Ӝ̵̨̄Ʒ</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Lotsa pasta</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>A researcher's day</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <h3><span>Tubby</span></h3> <p>Morphing in what it has consumed<br /> It's still cuter than I assumed<br /> This feline fabric grey plushy<br /> <em>Am hungry, gimme a munchy!</em></p> <p>Remains are regurgitated<br /> Mostly organic related<br /> It's jaw still ever so stretchy<br /> <em>Am hungry, gimme a munchy!</em></p> <p>Soul devourer, corpse consumer<br /> For some biscuits, GoI defuser<br /> The good ones, so crisp and crunchy<br /> <em>Am hungry, gimme a munchy!</em></p> <p>Inspired by: <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4966">SCP-4966</a> from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deadly-bread" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3988532&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606400314" alt="Deadly Bread" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3988532)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deadly-bread" >Deadly Bread</a></span></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <h3><span>●●|●●●●●|●●|●</span></h3> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">-&#32;....&#32;..&#32;...&#32;/&#32;.--&#32;.&#32;..&#32;.-.&#32;-..&#32;/&#32;-..&#32;.-&#32;.-.&#32;-.-&#32;/&#32;-.-.&#32;.-.&#32;.&#32;.-&#32;-&#32;..-&#32;.-.&#32;.&#32;/&#32;.--&#32;..&#32;.-..&#32;.-..&#32;/&#32;-.-.&#32;.-..&#32;.-&#32;..&#32;--&#32;/&#32;.-&#32;.-..&#32;.-..</span><b