&#32;---&#32;-.&#32;.----.&#32;-&#32;/&#32;-.-.&#32;.-..&#32;.-&#32;..&#32;--&#32;/&#32;.--.&#32;.-.&#32;---&#32;...&#32;.</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">..&#32;-&#32;/&#32;.&#32;-.&#32;-&#32;.-&#32;-.&#32;--.&#32;.-..&#32;.&#32;...&#32;/&#32;--&#32;.&#32;--..--&#32;/&#32;....&#32;---&#32;.-..&#32;-..&#32;...&#32;/&#32;--&#32;.&#32;/&#32;-.-.&#32;.-..&#32;---&#32;...&#32;.</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">---&#32;....&#32;--..--&#32;/&#32;-.&#32;---&#32;-.-.--&#32;/&#32;.--.&#32;.-..&#32;.&#32;.-&#32;...&#32;.&#32;--..--&#32;/&#32;...&#32;-&#32;---&#32;.--.&#32;-.-.--&#32;/&#32;..&#32;.----.&#32;--&#32;/&#32;-.&#32;---&#32;-&#32;/&#32;-.--&#32;.&#32;-&#32;/&#32;-..&#32;---&#32;-.&#32;.&#32;-.-.--</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">-...&#32;.&#32;/&#32;.-&#32;.--&#32;.-&#32;.-.&#32;.&#32;/&#32;---&#32;..-.&#32;●●|●●●●●|●●|●</span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Translation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Close&nbsp;translation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><br /> This weird dark creature will claim all<br /> That mentions it's name big or small<br /> Don't speak nor write. Really, do none.<br /> Be aware of two five two one</p> <p>It'll come to you, in any place<br /> No escape from this sweet embrace<br /> You tried hard, still fail to outrun<br /> Be aware of two five two one</p> <p>I do hope, that it won't claim prose<br /> It entangles me, holds me close<br /> Oh, no! Please, stop! I'm not yet done!<br /> Be aware of two five two one</p> </div> </div> </div> <br /> Inspired by: <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-2521">●●|●●●●●|●●|●</a> from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606400314" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <h3><span>Harbinger</span></h3> <p>In the Kuiper, we found a tear<br /> More than billion gone years dormant<br /> It brings a message we must hear<br /> The most important informant</p> <p>More than billion gone years dormant<br /> The mission, Harbinger must tell<br /> The most important informant<br /> From beyond the planets it fell</p> <p>The mission, Harbinger must tell<br /> The galaxy, dark, empty, cold<br /> From beyond the planets it fell<br /> Oh, how sad fates will unfold</p> <p>The galaxy, dark, empty, cold<br /> Proceed our good signaled tiding<br /> Oh, how sad fates will unfold<br /> Please, send your Harbinger flying</p> <p>Proceed our good signaled tiding<br /> Send this message spacewards on<br /> Please, send your Harbinger flying<br /> <em>Masters&#8230;</em> Yes, Harbinger well done</p> <p>Send this message spacewards on<br /> In the Kuiper, we found a tear<br /> <em>Masters&#8230;</em> Yes, Harbinger well done<br /> It brings a message we must hear</p> <p>Inspired by: <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-1281">SCP-1281</a> from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dreverettmann" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=323946&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606400314" alt="DrEverettMann" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=323946)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dreverettmann" >DrEverettMann</a></span></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <p>Kind of requested in the sense that Calibri likes them and asked me if I tried it before. I didn't so here are my first limericks.</p> <h3><span>No One Expects The Spanish Decommission!</span></h3> <p>The most beautiful Spanish ship<br /> Gave the economy a dip<br /> Wants some silver, some gold<br /> Reduced to ashes' cold<br /> Decommissioned, a last sea trip</p> <p>Inspired by: <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4456">SCP-4456-D</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606400314" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span></p> <hr /> <h3><span>The cat went to the well</span></h3> <p>The curious cat went to the well<br /> Below the bricks in the pit it fell<br /> For eight times no avail<br /> only shortened the tail<br /> The ninth time though, it didn't live to tell</p> <p>Inspired by: Inspired by: <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-2693">SCP-2693</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606400314" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>Ƹ̵̡Ӝ̵̨̄Ʒ</span></h3> <p>My friend<br /> In the garden<br /> Doodling on a book page<br /> In a garden party event<br /> You have<br /> Finally found your happiness<br /> Let's talk a bit longer<br /> You beautiful<br /> Insect</p> </div> <br /> Inspired by: <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5096">SCP-5096</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dianaberry" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3444428&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606400314" alt="DianaBerry" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3444428)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dianaberry" >DianaBerry</a></span></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-5" style="display:none"> <h3><span><em>Lotsa pasta</em></span></h3> <p>Oh ma goodness! What a ton of pasta!<br /> Linguini, capellini, and fettuccini<br /> Mamma mia, make it stop. Please, basta!<br /> Tortellini, rigatoni, and rotini</p> <p>Linguini, capellini, and fettuccini<br /> Now bigoli, gigli, what is mostaccioli?<br /> Tortellini, rigatoni, and rotini<br /> Damn, why is this pasta so goddamn wriggly?</p> <p>Now bigoli, gigli, what is mostaccioli?<br /> Oh, great the lose spaghetti can now talk<br /> Damn, why is this pasta so goddamn wriggly?<br /> I'd rather Bangkok noodles in some stock</p> <p>Oh, great the lose spaghetti can now talk<br /> Can't we have permission to boil them all?<br /> I'd rather Bangkok noodles in some stock<br /> Oh, shit! Of course, I made the damn box fall</p> <p>Can't we have permission to boil them all?<br /> Oh ma goodness! What a ton of pasta!<br /> Oh, shit! Of course, I made the damn box fall<br /> Mamma mia, make it stop. Please, basta!</p> <p>Inspired by: <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-41d3n73-j">SCP-41-D3N73-J</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trennerdios" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1277937&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606400314" alt="trennerdios" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1277937)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trennerdios" >trennerdios</a></span></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-6" style="display:none"> <h3><span>A researcher’s day</span></h3> <p>Raindrops wake me, in every fiber of my being.<br /> Except my mind, there I'm still dreaming.<br /> I take a cup of tea, it's too early and too grey.<br /> So somber, so weak, what a horrible day.</p> <p>I put on my coat, hood over my head.<br /> Damn this rain, I want to go back to bed.<br /> I get in my car and start the tires.<br /> Arrived at last, the caffeine expires.</p> <p>I turn in my coat for a whiter one.<br /> Must focus, procedure has begun.<br /> Needed here to observe a test.<br /> But I cannot help to feel stressed.</p> <p>Subject keeps getting stranger.<br /> Don't provoke, D-class in danger.<br /> Containment breached, stupid keter.<br /> Results lost, all in the ether.</p> <p>Got to control room, with little time bought.<br /> Called for help, anomaly caught.<br /> Explained to highers and senior.<br /> No idea, why it's keener.</p> <p>It's murderous but in very bad shape.<br /> How the hell did it manage to escape?<br /> It can't leave site, security max degree.<br /> But why do I think it's already free?</p> <p>Going back home like the rest of the staff.<br /> Can't help but to inner laugh.<br /> Oh my, how they can't see…<br /> That I'm part of this SCP.</p> <p>Inspired by: A poem I wrote earlier for the wiki in basic AABB. Didn't post it because other things came up. I figured I could put it here instead of forgetting it.</p> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Used&nbsp;formats</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Close&nbsp;formats</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>I did not necessarily stay true to these formats, but that also is the beauty of freedom poetry brings.</p> <p><strong>Kyrielle:</strong> A French form in quatrains with 8 syllables per line that have AABB rhyme. Each quatrain must end with the same line. Fourth line gets repeated, all 3<sup>rd</sup> and 4<sup>th</sup> lines rhyme.</p> <p><strong>Phantoum:</strong> Quatrains where the second and fourth line become the first and the third line in the following quatrain. In the last quatrain the second and fourth line are the first and third of the first quatrain. Every line gets used twice. ABAB rhyme.</p> <p><strong>Limerick:</strong> They only have 5 lines but they do count syllables and rhyme (AABBA). The most commonly known limericks are probably nursery rhymes.</p> <p><strong>Butterfly:</strong> 9 lines with 2-4-6-8-2-8-6-4-2 syllable count.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6438262&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606400314" alt="Sirslash47" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6438262)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47" >Sirslash47</a></span></p> 
