&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha:&lt;/strong&gt; Where are we?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#039;re almost there, Alpha - dive team, be advised, we’re picking up movement from the entity on radar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha:&lt;/strong&gt; I&amp;#8212; Barry, I don’t see anything down here, what are we supposed to be looking-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foxtrot:&lt;/strong&gt; All&amp;#8230; all I can see is darkness. There&#039;s a chill foul wind blowing, pushing me towards a brink I can&#039;t see-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpha:&lt;/strong&gt; Shut up, shut up, shut up - Command, Bravo is unresponsive, requesting immediate cessation of mission-&lt;/p&gt;
